%% Sales Management System — Clean Architecture
flowchart TD

    subgraph Web["SalesManagementSystem.Web  (Presentation)"]
        Controllers["Controllers<br/>Dashboard · Categories · Customers · Products · Sales · Reports"]
        Views["Razor Views + Bootstrap 5"]
        ViewModels["ViewModels"]
    end

    subgraph Application["SalesManagementSystem.Application"]
        Services["Services<br/>CategoryService · CustomerService · ProductService · SaleService · ReportService"]
        Interfaces["Repository & IUnitOfWork interfaces"]
        Rules["Business rule validation"]
    end

    subgraph Domain["SalesManagementSystem.Domain"]
        Entities["Entities<br/>Category · Customer · Product · Sale · SaleItem<br/>(no dependencies)"]
    end

    subgraph Infrastructure["SalesManagementSystem.Infrastructure"]
        DbCtx["SalesDbContext (EF Core)"]
        EFConfig["IEntityTypeConfiguration classes<br/>(maps to store.* schema, incl. computed TotalAmount)"]
        RepoImpl["Repository + UnitOfWork implementations"]
    end

    DB[("SQL Server<br/>SALES_DB")]

    Web --> Application
    Application --> Domain
    Infrastructure --> Application
    Infrastructure --> Domain
    Web -. "DI wiring only (Program.cs)" .-> Infrastructure

    RepoImpl --> DbCtx
    EFConfig --> DbCtx
    DbCtx --> DB
